455852.overview:
Alphabet Blocks is an educational game for a child to learn the English alphabet sounds and names. Accompanied by a talking coach, Bananas (the monkey) or Jack (the jack-in-the-box), the player enters the playroom with a stack of colorful alphabet blocks, a bright red soldier, a traditional chalkboard, and over 50 animated surprises. Clicking on the coaches to make them talk, the player receives the question and should select the correct answer in one of four mini-games:

Match letters;
Identify letters by name;
Identify letters by sound;
Identify words that begin with a letter sound.
